### Setup Summary
{% set sections = [
  (r.names, 'name', 'Name'),
  (r.descriptions, 'description', 'Description'),
  (r.personas, 'personas', 'Personas'),
  (r.documents, 'documents', 'Documents'),
  (r.parameter_fields, 'parameter_fields_ids', 'Parameter Fields'),
  (r.problem_statements, 'problem_statement', 'Problem Statement (exactly 1)'),
  (r.objectives, 'objectives', 'Objectives'),
  (r.videos, 'video_id', 'Video (required for questions)'),
  (r.questions, 'questions', 'Questions (require video)'),
  (r.options, 'options_ids', 'Options (require questions)'),
  (r.images, 'image_id', 'Image (chat mode only)'),
] -%}
**Needs input:**
{% for sec, arg, label in sections %}{% if section_status(sec) == 'needs_input' %}- {{ label }} → `{{ arg }}`
