{% set has_locked = [] %}{% for sec, arg, label in sections %}{% if section_status(sec) == 'locked' %}{% if has_locked.append(1) %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if has_locked -%}
**Locked (already set):**
{% for sec, arg, label in sections %}{% if section_status(sec) == 'locked' %}- {{ label }}
{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
**Auto-configured:** departments, scenarios, config flags

